 SEC).", "category": "dirigeant", "source_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1410636/000141063626000094/0001410636-26-000094-index.htm", "_accession": "0001410636-26-000094", "_item": "5.02"}, {"date": "2026-03-10", "title_fr": "Événement significatif", "description_fr": "American Water Works Company rapporte un événement significatif via un formulaire 8-K déposé auprès de la SEC (Item 8.01).", "category": "strategie", "source_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1410636/000141063626000056/0001410636-26-000056-index.htm", "_accession": "0001410636-26-000056", "_item": "8.01"}, {"date": "2026-03-02", "title_fr": "Événement significatif", "description_fr": "American Water Works Company rapporte un événement significatif via un formulaire 8-K déposé auprès de la SEC (Item 8.01).", "category": "strategie", "source_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1410636/000141063626000053/0001410636-26-000053-index.htm", "_accession": "0001410636-26-000053", "_item": "8.01"}, {"date": "2026-02-18", "title_fr": "Publication des résultats", "description_fr": "American Water Works Company publie ses résultats trimestriels via un communiqué déposé auprès de la SEC (Item 2.02 du 8-K).", "category": "financier", "source_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1410636/000141063626000035/0001410636-26-000035-index.htm", "_accession": "0001410636-26-000035", "_item": "2.02"}], "company_description": "American Water Works Company, Inc., through its subsidiaries, provides water and wastewater services in the United States. It offers water and wastewater services on military installations; and undertakes contracts with municipal customers, primarily to operate and manage water and wastewater facilities, as well as offers other related services. The company also operates approximately 80 surface water treatment plants; 520 groundwater treatment plants; 170 wastewater treatment plants; 55,000 miles of transmission, distribution, and collection mains and pipes; 1,200 groundwater wells; 1,800 water and wastewater pumping stations; 1,100 treated water storage facilities; and 75 dams. In addition, it offers water and wastewater services to 14 states serving approximately 3.6 million active customers. The company serves residential customers; commercial customers, including food and beverage providers, commercial property developers and proprietors, and energy suppliers; fire service and private fire customers; industrial customers, such as large-scale manufacturers, mining, and production operations; public authorities comprising government buildings and other public sector facilities, ", "customer_type": {"primary": "Mixed", "label": "La société dessert à la fois des clients résidentiels (B2C) et des clients commerciaux, industriels et publics (B2B).", "_source": "Cerebras Qwen-3 10-K"}, "revenue_by_segment": {"label": "Répartition du chiffre d'affaires par segment opérationnel", "slices": [{"name": "Regulated Businesses", "value": 3.384, "unit": "Mds $", "pct": 86.1, "share_pct": 86.1, "label_en": "Regulated Businesses"}, {"name": "Market-Based Businesses", "value": 0.563, "unit": "Mds $", "pct": 14.3, "share_pct": 14.3, "label_en": "Market-Based Businesses"}], "total": 3.95, "unit": "Mds $", "_segment_verified_at": "2026-07-13T02:00:00Z"}, "_blocs_extracted_at": "2026-06-01T15:45:02Z", "geography": {"unit": "MUSD", "slices": [{"name": "United States", "value": 3950, "share_pct": 100}]}, "description": "American Water Works est la plus grande utility privée d'eau et d'assainissement aux États-Unis, basée à Camden dans le New Jersey. Le groupe fournit des services d'eau potable et d'assainissement à plus de 14 millions de personnes dans 14 États, principalement à travers des concessions municipales rachetées. American Water opère deux segments : Regulated Businesses (utility eau régulée, 90% des revenus) et Military Services (gestion long terme des infrastructures eau des bases militaires américaines). La société poursuit une stratégie d'acquisition de petites municipalités (tuck-in M&A) à hauteur de 200-300 M$ par an. L'effectif est d'environ 6 500 personnes. Le titre est au NYSE et fait partie du S&P 500.", "_top307_resumed_by": "subagent-top307-group2-2026-06-01", "_top307_resumed_at": "2026-06-01T14:01:43.860423+00:00", "revenue_by_geography": {"unit": "%", "slices": [{"label": "États-Unis", "value": 100, "share_pct": 100, "single_region_legitimate": true, "unit": "%", "label_en": "United States"}], "total": 100, "source": "10-K exercice 2025 : Item 1 : Business", "_single_geography": "United States", "_source_quote": "Regulated Businesses provide water and wastewater services in 14 U.S. states. Substantially all of the Company's properties are owned by its subsidiaries.", "_category": "utility-us", "_tagged_by": "sub-agent-geo-fill-2026-07-12", "_tagged_at": "2026-07-12T17:30:08.588992Z"}, "_maj_at": "2026-06-01T21:14:11Z", "_maj_by": "Sub-agent Opus MAJ chunk-02", "_old_hero": "Regulated Revenue", "_hero_changed_by": "Sub-agent Opus EU narrative chunk-10", "_hero_change_failure_reason": "extension absente ou <16 trims | _super_kpi_inputs.revenue_q=float(0) | _quarterly_history_extension=Revenue/quarter/5trims", "_hero_change_failed_at": "2026-06-01T21:41:43.144503+00:00", "_hero_review_status": "auto_proposed_uncertain", "_hero_last_set_at": "2026-06-04T18:39:40.783156Z", "_hero_last_set_by": "vague2-chunk1-sample", "_hero_previous": "Total Revenue", "_superkpi_backfill_at": "2026-06-09T22:35:20Z", "_superkpi_backfill_added": ["Capex", "Operating Margin"], "latest_filing": {"date": "2026-04-29", "eps_actual": 1.01, "revenue_actual": 1207000000, "_source": "FMP"}, "_earnings_refreshed": "2026-06-11 FMP", "_events_regenerated_at": "2026-07-13T00:00:00Z", "_events_source": "SEC 8-K primary filings (data-lake)", "_ai_positioning_regenerated_at": "2026-07-13T01:00:00Z", "_ai_positioning_source": "10-K local extract, primary source", "_kpis_dedup_removed": [], "revenue_history": {"